lockdownReply(true, false)
	🔒 Lockdown: only read-only work runs now. Nothing that writes, sends or submits goes ahead, and no approval is asked. Send !unlock, or unlock it in the dashboard, to end it.
lockdownReply(true, true)
	🔒 The bridge is in lockdown already. Send !unlock, or unlock it in the dashboard, to end it.
lockdownReply(false, false)
	🔓 Unlocked: the brains work as before.
lockdownReply(false, true)
	🔓 The bridge is not in lockdown.
lockdownOwnerOnly
	🔒 Only the owner can lock the bridge down or unlock it.
lockdownRefusedNotice
	🔒 The bridge is in lockdown, so this was not run: it needs more than reading. Unlock it in the dashboard or with !unlock, then send it again.
rateLimitedNotice(20)
	⏳ This chat started 20 runs in the last hour, the most allowed. Try again later.
